 "result_text": "I fixed this in `aws_google_auth/__init__.py`, but I haven't run the tool or any tests, so it's untested.\n\nWhen no profile was set, `config.profile` was `None`, and the tool still wrote credentials under a section named `[None]`. A second run then added another `[None]` section, which is what triggered the `DuplicateSectionError`.\n\nThe fix is that with no profile, the tool now only prints the `export ...` lines. It no longer touches `~/.aws/credentials` or the config file. With a profile, it stores credentials as before.\n\nAn existing `~/.aws/credentials` file that already has `[None]` sections will still have them. Delete those sections by hand.",
